lver Bulletin, Fox News and RealClearPolitics — place it Solid or Safe Democratic. Betting markets on Kalshi and PredictIt each price Becerra near 96 percent.\n\nThe campaign has been spirited: the candidates met in a testy early-October debate centered on Trump, Hilton holds a slight fundraising edge, and recent tabloid coverage has teased a tightening poll. Even so, nothing documented points to a genuine toss-up, and the structural advantage Democrats enjoy in the state remains decisive. Becerra enters the final weeks as the strong favorite; an upset would require a major, sustained late shift.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.9963, "margin": 17.38}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.998, "margin": 20.0}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.9982, "margin": 20.0}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.998, "margin": 21.0}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.9936, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.9916, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-09-28", "p_dem": 0.996, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-09-29", "p_dem": 0.9966, "margin": 19.0}, {"date": "2026-09-30", "p_dem": 0.9966, "margin": 20.0}, {"date": "2026-10-01", "p_dem": 0.998, "margin": 20.0}, {"date": "2026-10-02", "p_dem": 0.9808, "margin": 14.8}, {"date": "2026-10-03", "p_dem": 0.9828, "margin": 15.0}, {"date": "2026-10-04", "p_dem": 0.9795, "margin": 14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-05", "p_dem": 0.9678, "margin": 13.5}, {"date": "2026-10-06", "p_dem": 0.9677, "margin": 13.5}, {"date": "2026-10-07", "p_dem": 0.9665, "margin": 13.5}, {"date": "2026-10-08", "p_dem": 0.9753, "margin": 14.0}, {"date": "2026-10-09", "p_dem": 0.9796, "margin": 15.0}, {"date": "2026-10-10", "p_dem": 0.9687, "margin": 13.5}]}